832
00:59:01,360 --> 00:59:04,495
Sim. Muito bom. Ah, sim!

833
00:59:04,496 --> 00:59:05,891
Ah!

834
00:59:05,892 --> 00:59:07,398
Sim!

835
00:59:07,399 --> 00:59:08,563
Legal, Gracie.

836
00:59:08,564 --> 00:59:09,524
Ele se mudou,

837
00:59:09,525 --> 00:59:12,164
